ren"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"慢性病兒童與家庭的護理：以家庭為中心、正常化與學校適應"}]},{"type":"text","value":"，兒童事故傷害見 "},{"type":"element","tagName":"k-link","properties":{"target":"pediatric-injuries"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"兒童事故傷害"}]},{"type":"text","value":"。文中縮寫：FCC(Family-Centered Care，以家庭為中心的照護)"}]}]},"sections":[{"id":"summary","depth":2,"number":"一、","title":"重點摘要","children":[{"id":"exam-points","depth":3,"number":"(一)","title":"國考常考點","children":[],"content":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"ul","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"賦權"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"不是"}]},{"type":"text","value":"「醫護人員有權決定病童的照護選擇」，而是強化家庭與病童的能力與決定權"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"以家庭為中心："},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"鼓勵父母與手足參與照護與決策"}]},{"type":"text","value":"；資訊"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"完整、誠實，不先過濾"}]},{"type":"text","value":"；探視時間"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"有彈性"}]},{"type":"text","value":"，不是嚴格限制或避免手足探視"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"賦權是支持家庭，不是「要求」父母一定要留在醫院照顧"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"加護病房也一樣適用：鼓勵父母、手足在可以時共同照顧；青少年的病情溝通要尊重本人，不只對父母說明"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"提供疫苗實證資料，協助父母決定是否接種 → "},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"預防保健照護者"}]},{"type":"text","value":"的角色"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"e